fixture five_parries_in_a_second
doc Presentation review r3, H1: five white swings land on frames 53, 57, 61, 65 and 69 and Ash parries every one; the hit feedback shows at most three full-screen flashes in those 60 ticks (BUILD.md section 12, the Harding test; test_presentation_review3).
room test/five_swings
frames 100
input
